&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Nenotori&amp;rdquo; is an omnibus-story silhouette cuckoldry ADV game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose one of three stories at the beginning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your actions during in the story won&amp;rsquo;t change it, each story is linear&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The setting is an alternate world where &amp;ldquo;golden birds&amp;rdquo; exist&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Original story, but also an homage to the classic manga&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
